AIRSPX='https://www.airtel.in/press-release/03-2025/airtel-announces-agreement-with-spacex-to-bring-starlinks-high-speed-internet-to-its-customers-in-india/'
AIR21='https://www.airtel.in/press-release/09-2021/bharti-airtel-welcomes-government-of-indias-seminal-reforms-for-the-telecom-industry'
